WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.011 --> 00:00:09.784
Swipe a foreign-currency record right to edit it, then open Exchange Rate

2
00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:25.392
Choose either direction. Here, enter 1 AUD = 110.510 JPY

3
00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:36.547
Check the conversion and save. The original amount and currency stay unchanged

4
00:00:36.547 --> 00:00:54.558
In Reports, open Exchange Rate to select records that still need a rate

5
00:00:54.558 --> 00:01:01.112
Save to update the total while keeping rates already entered

6
00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:34.199
Switch the primary currency to USD; those records now need USD rates

7
00:01:34.199 --> 00:01:59.488
Switch back to AUD to reuse the saved rates

8
00:01:59.488 --> 00:02:13.006
If the card's final charge is known, edit the record and choose Exchange Rate → Amount

9
00:02:13.006 --> 00:02:40.190
Enter the final AUD 103.25 charge, including fees, to calculate the effective rate

10
00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:54.033
Save to total the exact charge while keeping the original JPY amount
